MODULE: PeerWriteNotShipped
TARGET: Converges
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: a peer write is never replicated back, and the one-directional link cannot repair it
PERTURBS: BWrite

--- FIND
    /\ inflight' = inflight \cup {[k |-> k, ts |-> clock + 1, del |-> FALSE, org |-> "B",
                                   via |-> "ship", to |-> "A"]}
--- REPLACE
    /\ inflight' = inflight
--- END
